exports[`deployed Harness API through the real product Loader > exposes safe platform-failure narration and unknown-outcome recovery on both native media tools > generate_video 1`] = `"Compatibility single-clip generation through the account relay. Read list_video_models first. Prefer generate_video_project for new video requests, including a single clip: its background job exposes queue and generation progress without holding chat open. Each independent human generation request defaults to one finished video, or its explicit work count. An earlier running or unknown submission does not block a separate human request, even with the same brief or plan; create independent work and retain the original task. Do not repeat the same submission. Progress checks and continuing the original task use its existing query or resume tools. Do not write submission, polling or download scripts or probe invalid paid durations. For story direction, character/reference continuity, dialogue or subtitles, use the yunshu-video-director skill. For a complete video such as 40 seconds or automatic assembly, always use generate_video_project; several camera beats may fit one clip. Accepted work that outlasts this foreground wait returns pending: query_video_task reads its original receipt without repeating that submission. Edit existing clips with edit_video. Only declared duration, resolution, ratio, frames and references are accepted. For failed operations, give users only a safe Simplified Chinese summary based on the observed failure category; connection failures and timeouts do not establish whether the cause is local, network, platform or upstream. Distinguish confirmed request or media validation, permission, rate limiting, service HTTP 5xx and upstream task failures; unknown causes remain unconfirmed; never repeat raw HTTP responses, diagnostic JSON, error codes, stacks, internal paths or credentials. Keep actionable guidance for confirmed sign-in, product-credit, file-validation and cancellation failures. When submission or billing outcome is unknown, check existing tasks and artifacts first; do not immediately retry or automatically resubmit. Preserve real tool results. This restriction does not prevent software or code diagnostics explicitly requested by the user."`;

